OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStorm Austen
OL,6,Fmoving east across southern areas
OL,7,Fovernight with damaging winds possible
OL,8,Fin Cornwall and west Devon later.
OL,9,FHeavy rain sweeping north across most
OL,10,Fareas with frequent squally showers
OL,11,Ffollowing to the south. Drier with
OL,12,Fsome frost in northeast Scotland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FSevere gales in the south and
OL,15,Fwest, these easing later. Winds
OL,16,Fincreasing through the day elsewhere,
OL,17,Fwith heavy rain or showers for many
OL,18,Fbut brighter further west. Feeling
OL,19,Frather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
